                 SOUTHWESTERN PUBLIC SERVICE COMPANY’S
            NOTICE OF SUBSTITUTION OF WITNESS AND ADOPTION OF
                           PREFILED TESTIMONY

       Southwestern Public Service Company (“SPS”) submits this notice that, due to SPS witness

Adrian J. Rodriguez’s departure from the company, SPS substitutes Zoë E. Lees, Regional Vice

President, Planning and Policy, as the sponsoring witness for Mr. Rodriguez’s November 20, 2025,

Direct Testimony.

       Ms. Lees is familiar with the contents of Mr. Rodriguez’s pre-filed testimony and adopts it

in full, except for the “Witness Identification and Qualifications” section, which will be replaced.

A revised qualifications page for Ms. Lees is attached to this Notice as Exhibit A. Ms. Lees is

qualified to testify on the subject matter of Mr. Rodriguez’s testimony and will be available to

sponsor it and respond to questions at the evidentiary hearing scheduled to begin on July 13, 2026.


